---
import { experiences } from '../data/experience';

const current = experiences.find((e) => e.active) ?? experiences[0];
const core = ['Jenkins', 'Quickbuild', 'Shell', 'Node.js', 'Coverity', 'Linux'];
---

<section id="summary" class="scroll-mt-24 py-[88px_0_72px] pb-18 pt-22">
  <p class="font-mono text-[12.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-accent">
    DevOps Engineer
  </p>

  <h1
    class="mt-3.5 text-[clamp(38px,6vw,58px)] font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.03em]"
  >
    이동욱
  </h1>

  <p
    class="mt-5 max-w-[30em] text-[clamp(19px,2.4vw,23px)] leading-[1.5] tracking-[-0.01em] break-keep"
  >
    안정적인 시스템 운영은 <strong class="font-bold">단순함</strong>에서 비롯된다고
    생각합니다.<br />
    그 목표를 향해 노력하는 <strong class="font-bold">DevOps Engineer</strong>입니다.
  </p>

  <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-10 gap-y-3">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <img
        src="/images/thundersoft-logo.png"
        alt="ThunderSoft 로고"
        width="1492"
        height="187"
        class="logo-invert h-4 w-auto"
        loading="eager"
      />
      <span class="text-[15px] font-semibold">{current.company}</span>
    </div>
    <span class="font-mono text-[13px] text-muted">{current.role}</span>
    <span class="font-mono text-[13px] text-muted">
      2023.09 ~ <span class="text-ok">재직 중</span>
    </span>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
    <span class="mr-1 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-faint">Core</span>
    {core.map((t) => (
      <span class="rounded-full border border-line-strong px-3 py-1 text-[13px] font-medium">
        {t}
      </span>
    ))}
  </div>
</section>
